{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues\/dismissSearch"},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI17EnvironmentValuesV13dismissSearchAA07DismissG6ActionVvp","roleHeading":"Instance Property","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"property","title":"dismissSearch","modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"extendedModule":"OpenSwiftUI","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dismissSearch","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI19DismissSearchActionV","text":"DismissSearchAction","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"dismissSearch"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI19DismissSearchActionV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissSearchAction","text":"DismissSearchAction"},{"kind":"text","text":" { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use this environment value to get the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissSearchAction","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" instance"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for the current "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Environment","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Then call the instance to dismiss"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the current search interaction. You call the instance directly because"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it defines a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissSearchAction\/callAsFunction()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" method that Swift"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"calls when you call the instance."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When you dismiss search, SwiftUI:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Sets "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues\/isSearching"},{"type":"text","text":" to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Clears any text from the search field."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Removes focus from the search field.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"style":"note","name":"Note","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Calling this instance has no effect if the user isn’t","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"interacting with a search field.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use this action to dismiss a search operation based on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"another user interaction. For example, consider a searchable","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"view with a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Button"},{"text":" that presents more information about the first","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"matching item from a collection:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["struct ContentView: View {","    @State private var text = \"\"","","    var body: some View {","        NavigationView {","            SearchResults(searchText: text)","                .searchable(text: $text)","        }","    }","}","","private struct SearchResults: View {","    let searchText: String","","    let items = [\"a\", \"b\", \"c\"]","    var filteredItems: [String] { items.filter { $0 == searchText.lowercased() } }","","    @State private var isPresented = false","","    var body: some View {","        if let item = filteredItems.first {","            Button(\"Details about \\(item)\") {","                isPresented = true","            }","            .sheet(isPresented: $isPresented) {","                NavigationView {","                    DetailView(item: item)","                }","            }","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":null},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The button becomes visible only after the user enters search text","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that produces a match. When the user taps the button, SwiftUI shows","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a sheet that provides more information about the item, including","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"an Add button for adding the item to a stored list of items:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["private struct DetailView: View {","    let item: String","","    @Environment(\\.dismiss) private var dismiss","    @Environment(\\.dismissSearch) private var dismissSearch","","    var body: some View {","        Text(\"Information about \\(item).\")","            .toolbar {","                Button(\"Add\") {","                    \/\/ Store the item here...","","                    dismiss()","                    dismissSearch()","                }","            }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":null},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The user can dismiss the sheet by dragging it down, effectively"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"canceling the operation, leaving the in-progress search interaction"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"intact. Alternatively, the user can tap the Add button to store the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"item. Because the user is likely to be done with both the detail view"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and the search interaction at this point, the button’s closure also"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"uses the "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues\/dismiss","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" property to dismiss the sheet,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and the "},{"code":"dismissSearch","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" property to reset the search field."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/environmentvalues\/dismisssearch"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An action that ends the current search interaction."}],"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/EnvironmentValues/dismiss":{"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dismiss","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DismissAction","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI13DismissActionV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues\/dismiss","title":"dismiss","abstract":[{"text":"An action that dismisses the current presentation.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/environmentvalues\/dismiss","type":"topic"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI":{"kind":"symbol","role":"collection","title":"OpenSwiftUI","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","abstract":[],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/DismissSearchAction":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An action that can end a search interaction."}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DismissSearchAction","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/dismisssearchaction","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DismissSearchAction","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissSearchAction","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"DismissSearchAction"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/EnvironmentValues":{"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EnvironmentValues","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"OpenSwiftUI exposes a collection of values to your app’s views in an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"EnvironmentValues","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" structure. To read a value from the structure,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"declare a property using the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Environment","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" property wrapper and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"specify the value’s key path. For example, you can read the current locale:","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EnvironmentValues","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"EnvironmentValues","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/environmentvalues"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/DismissSearchAction/callAsFunction()":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"callAsFunction","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"()","kind":"text"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Dismisses the current search operation, if any."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissSearchAction\/callAsFunction()","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/dismisssearchaction\/callasfunction()","title":"callAsFunction()","kind":"symbol"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/EnvironmentValues/isSearching":{"url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/environmentvalues\/issearching","title":"isSearching","abstract":[{"text":"A Boolean value that indicates when the user is searching.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isSearching","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues\/isSearching","type":"topic"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/Environment":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Environment","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Environment","role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/environment","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Environment","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A property wrapper that reads a value from a view’s environment."}],"kind":"symbol","title":"Environment"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/EnvironmentValues/dismissSearch":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"dismissSearch"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI19DismissSearchActionV","text":"DismissSearchAction"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/environmentvalues\/dismisssearch","abstract":[{"text":"An action that ends the current search interaction.","type":"text"}],"title":"dismissSearch","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues\/d